Project Report — my-website
Final handover document. Everything learned about this project across the entire session. Written to be pasted at the top of a future chat so work can continue without re-discovery.

Revision 2 — includes the nested menu feature and inline edit added on 2026-09-11.

1. Overview
A Laravel CMS with a public blog/site and an admin panel. Admin manages pages, blog posts, categories, a navigation menu (now arbitrarily nested), and global theme settings. Content is edited with CKEditor 5 (self-hosted GPL build). Admin authentication uses Laravel Breeze.

2. Environment
Framework      Laravel 12
Auth           Laravel Breeze (Blade stack)
Build          Vite 7.3.6
CSS            Tailwind CSS v3 + @tailwindcss/forms
JS             Alpine.js, Axios
Editor         CKEditor 5 v48.5.0 (npm, GPL build)
Database       SQLite (database/database.sqlite)
Local server   php artisan serve at http://127.0.0.1:8000
OS             Windows
Shell          PowerShell
Editor         VS Code
Project root   C:\Users\marcl\Desktop\my-website

